@* Every Razor snippet the MudBlazor showcase can generate, verbatim.

   This file exists to be COMPILED: it is the proof that what a visitor copies out of the code
   panel actually builds. Do not hand-edit the block between the markers — SnippetCorpusTests
   regenerates it and will fail if it drifts. Fix the curation, not the corpus.

   The @code block at the bottom stands in for the fields a host declares beside its own bench;
   the snippets reference them by the @_camelCase names the generator emits for values that have
   no literal form. Their names are part of the generated output, so if one changes here it is
   because the curation changed there.
*@
@using System.Linq.Expressions
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Forms
@using MudBlazor
@using PlayBlazor.DemoHost

@* ==> generated snippets begin — see SnippetCorpusTests <== *@

